Apache Caldera (incubating) is an effort undergoing incubation at The Apache
Software Foundation (ASF), sponsored by the Apache Incubator. Incubation is
required of all newly accepted projects until a further review indicates that
the infrastructure, communications, and decision-making process have
stabilized in a manner consistent with other successful ASF projects. While
incubation status is not necessarily a reflection of the completeness or
stability of the code, it does indicate that the project has yet to be fully
endorsed by the ASF.

Some of the incubating project's releases may not be fully compliant with ASF
policy. For example, releases may have incomplete or un-reviewed licensing
conditions. What follows is a list of issues the project is currently aware
of (this list is likely to be incomplete):

 - Source files do not yet carry the ASF source header, and the build has no
   Apache RAT configuration to check headers and licenses.

 - The source release bundles the Font Awesome Free 5.15.3 web fonts
   (static/css/webfonts/), which are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
   ASF policy treats this license as Category B, which is meant for
   convenience binaries rather than source releases.

 - The source release bundles third-party JavaScript and CSS in minified form
   without the matching unminified source: static/js/lib/alpine.min.js,
   bulma-toast.min.js, confetti.browser.min.js and muuri.min.js;
   static/jquery/jquery.min.js; static/css/lib/bulma-tooltip.min.css and
   fa-all.min.css. alpine.min.js and confetti.browser.min.js carry no
   copyright or license notice, and the others carry only a short banner;
   LICENSE and the licenses/ directory supply the full notices.
   static/css/lib/custom-bulma.css and its .map file are generated from the
   Sass sources under static/scss/.

 - Some bundled third-party files have been modified locally
   (static/jquery/jquery.multi-select.js, static/css/multi-select.css,
   static/css/lib/bulma-tooltip.min.css), and static/jquery/jquery.min.js
   has been reformatted. LICENSE identifies them.

 - The origin and license of the images under static/img/ have not been
   reviewed. Some of them are operating system logos that are trademarks of
   their owners.

 - Plugins, including the web interface (magma), are git submodules hosted
   outside the ASF. They are not part of this source release and have not
   been reviewed for it. conf/default.yml enables several of them.

